{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56985","headline":"鄜州云岩县库利川土谚 · 佚名","name":"鄜州云岩县库利川土谚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔有奴贼，居此川内。\n（稽胡呼奴爲库利。\n见同书卷三五）（按：《太平寰宇记》爲乐史於宋初所着书。\n其所引二谚，应爲唐五代时之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}